# EXPO_PUBLIC_* vars are inlined into the JS bundle at build time - fine for
# a base API URL, never put a secret here.
#
# The dev machine's LAN IP, not localhost: the Android emulator's "localhost"
# points at the emulator itself, not the host (iOS Simulator and a physical
# device on the same Wi-Fi both work fine with a LAN IP too, so this one
# value covers every target). Matches apps/web's `allowedDevOrigins` in
# next.config.ts, which the web dev server needs to accept the request at
# all. If your machine's IP differs, update both.
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://192.168.1.64:3000
